db.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16px9.jpg"}, {"id": 1993140, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16px0.jpg"}, {"id": 1993142, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16px2.jpg"}, {"id": 1993141, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16px1.jpg"}, {"id": 1993143, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16px3.jpg"}, {"id": 1993144, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16px4.jpg"}, {"id": 1993150, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16pxa.jpg"}], "slug": "jingle-janitor", "storyline": "You're the first human ever hired at Santa's workshop, and it's a week before Christmas. On your very first night, a crash echoes from the break room. Four elves have partied until dawn, and the workshop is in pieces. Toys are scattered across the Jingle Joinery, wrapping paper is everywhere in the Wrappery, the Reindeer Runway is dark and the reindeer are hungry.\n\nWith the hungover elves cheering you on and their magic wands in your hand, you sort, stack and shelve your way through every corner of the workshop, lifting the elves' spirits as each area comes back to life. Santa arrives in the morning. Will he walk into a spotless workshop?", "summary": "Your first night as Santa's janitor, and the elves partied all night. Sort a gloriously messy workshop until every toy part sits on its shelf, learn handy magic, cheer up the elves and save Christmas. Cozy first-person tidying, alone or with a friend on the couch.", "themes": [{"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/jingle-janitor", "videos": [{"id": 203584, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "P3M67JO2KUg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P3M67JO2KUg", "title": "Jingle Janitor | Official Trailer | Cozy Christmas Tidying Game with Couch Co-op", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/P3M67JO2KUg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 203585, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "oOUvmtnydho", "url":